        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Scarf of silk Chiné gauze with deep end borders checked in green, black, red and yellow. The warp is printed in black, red and yellow with the weft woven in black, pink and yellow silk. There are pale pink bands printed at regular intervals along the central field."@en ;
